cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: Werkstadt
abstract: >-
  A live 3D world for your Claude Code sessions. Reads the session
  transcripts Claude Code already writes to ~/.claude/projects/**/*.jsonl
  and renders them as a planet, an island, and a walkable city, entirely
  on the user's own machine.
type: software
